@startuml
title Enigma — Iterative Process Flow
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FE
  BorderColor #1A73E8
  ArrowColor #1A73E8
  FontName Helvetica
  FontSize 13
}
start
:Communication\n(personas, interviews, open questions);
:Planning\n(scope cut, risks, tech stack, KPIs);
repeat
  :Modeling\n(domain model, state machine,\narchitecture, DB schema);
repeat while (design review passes?) is (no - revise)
:Construction\n(code + unit/integration tests);
:Demo & Feedback\n(professor / course peers);
note right
  Feedback returns to Communication
  for the next iteration:
  Itr-1 (MVP) -> Itr-2 (v1) -> Itr-3 (v2)
end note
-> Deployment;
:D-1  CI/CD + staging environment;
:D-2  Release MVP to pilot communities;
:D-3  Monitor KPIs vs go/no-go gates;
stop
@enduml
